              "value": 13
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "Your magic rivals that of lesser dragons. Choose one 3rd-level spell and one 4th-level spell from those listed for a dragon spellcaster of your draconic exemplar's type, as on pages 104–126 of the Bestiary (such as paralyze and stinking cloud for a black dragon exemplar). You can cast each of these spells once per day as arcane innate spells."
            }
          }
